title: "SecurAgentX: Venom-Themed AI Penetration Testing Framework"
abstract: "An autonomous AI agent framework for security research featuring a 3D Venom avatar with audio-driven lip-sync, 47 security tools, 501 pentest skills, a SAST code scanner, and brutal Playwright testing. Built on @met4citizen/talkinghead (MIT), Tone.js (MIT), and Three.js (MIT)."
